@startuml
title National Voice with extra product limited balance

skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor<<blackbox>> Black
  ParticipantFontColor<<blackbox>> White
}

participant "SmartPhone" as Phone #purple
participant "NetworkFunction" as NF #lightblue
participant "OCS_ChargingFunction" as OCF #lightblue

box "ServiceBalanceManagement"
  participant "OCS_AccountBalanceMgmt" as ABMF #blue
  participant "OCS_RatingFunction_a" as RFa #blue
end box

box "ProductUsageManagement"
  participant "OCS_RatingFunction_b" as RFb <<blackbox>>
end box

participant "OCS_ChargingDataFunction" as CDF
participant "OCS_ChargingGatewayFunction" as CGF

Phone -> NF : 1 start voice call
activate NF
note right of NF : Voice call starts 8:30:55 PM
NF -> OCF : 2 authorize voice call
activate OCF

OCF -> CDF : 3 Open CDR
CDF --> OCF : 4 CDR Opened

OCF -> ABMF : 5 get applicable balances for service
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 6 balances for service retrieved
ABMF --> OCF : 7
deactivate ABMF

OCF -> RFa : 8 determine value of the session and pass in balances
activate RFa
RFa -> RFa : 9 value determined based on\nparameters and service details.\nincrement change detected
note right of CDF : 60s increment used before 8PM and\n30s increment used after 8PM
RFa --> OCF : 10 value established including expiry time for current calculation
deactivate RFa

OCF -> OCF : 11 determine reservation amount
note right of OCF : value determined as 3*30 depleting the balance

OCF -> ABMF : 12 reserve balance
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 13 balance reservation added
ABMF --> OCF : 14 balance reservation successful
deactivate ABMF

OCF --> NF : 15 authorize session
note right of OCF
  as this is a non-blocking session
  a session metering quota as per operator requirements
  is set for how long to keep the session open.
  In theory it can be infinite as this is non-blocking
end note
NF --> Phone : 16 start voice call
note left of Phone : User starts the call

Phone -> NF : 17 voice call ends
note left of Phone : User ends call at 8:39:03 PM
NF -> OCF : 18 finalize voice call

OCF -> OCF : 19 determine the final value for the balance used
note right of ABMF : value and rules already known

OCF -> ABMF : 20 debit balance
activate ABMF
ABMF -> ABMF : 21 balance debited
note right of CDF : final amount for first part debited based on\n30s increment reduced from balance
ABMF --> OCF : 22 balance debit successful
deactivate ABMF

OCF -> CDF : 23 Update CDR
CDF --> OCF : 24 CDR updated with balance information

OCF -> RFb : 25 determine value of the remaining part exceeding the balance
activate RFb
note right of RFb : 1€/10 minutes according to the Mobile Line product
RFb -> RFb : 26 value determined based on\nparameters and service details
RFb --> OCF : 27 value established
deactivate RFb

OCF --> NF : 28 finalization completed
deactivate NF

OCF -> CDF : 29 Close CDR
activate CDF
CDF -> CGF : 30 Finalized CDR
note right of CGF : the finalized event includes the information\nabout the charged price
CDF --> OCF : 31 CDR Closed
deactivate CDF
deactivate OCF

@enduml
